---
description: >-
  A single `connector` declaration (GitHub API, with protocol/endpoint/
  token_required metadata) bound to a `tool` node via `connectorRef`, fed
  by an `input` node.
---
agentflow-beta LR
  connector github["GitHub API"]
  github@{ protocol: "http", endpoint: "https://api.github.com", token_required: true }

  query["query"]
  query@{ shape: input }
  fetch_issues["fetch_issues"]
  fetch_issues@{ shape: tool, connectorRef: "github.list_issues" }
  query --> fetch_issues
